        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Hobbit: The Desolation of Smaug\n- People: Peter Jackson\n- Companies: WingNut Films, New Line Cinema, Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Studios Inc.\n- Topics: Film production, Film distribution, Television production\n\nFacts:\n- In 2013, The Hobbit: The Desolation of Smaug was released as an epic high fantasy adventure film.\n- Peter Jackson directed The Hobbit: The Desolation of Smaug.\n- WingNut Films produced The Hobbit: The Desolation of Smaug in collaboration with New Line Cinema and Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer.\n- Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Studios Inc., also known as MGM or M-G-M, is an American media company.\n- Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer Studios Inc. is involved primarily in the production and distribution of feature films and television programs.",
